+**Reconciliation result (reference motor, 12 ang/slot, 8 airgap layers):**
+
+| | Ke/Ke_anal | Ld (mH) | Lq (mH) | Ld+L_ew (mH) |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| 2D FEM | 1.001 | 0.0852 | 0.0784 | 0.0930 |
+| 3D FEM (pure extrusion) | 1.005 | 0.0857 | 0.0790 | 0.0935 |
